Brand Studio for DeepSeek Harness
=================================

This is an unofficial, community-built plugin. It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or sponsored by DeepSeek.

Trademarks
----------
"DeepSeek", "DeepSeek Harness", the DeepSeek whale mark and the "HARNESS" badge
are trademarks or registered trademarks of their respective owner. Their use
here is nominative only: the plugin shows them by leaving DeepSeek Harness's own
brand occupants in place, never by shipping the logo as its own asset.

Third-party artwork
-------------------
`client.js` contains the glyph geometry of the official "HARNESS" badge
(`HARNESS_GLYPHS`), extracted from the wordmark SVG that ships inside the
DeepSeek Harness desktop application. It is reproduced only so that a custom
brand name can be followed by a badge that matches the official artwork exactly.

That geometry remains the property of its owner and is **not** covered by this
project's MIT license. The MIT license applies to the rest of the plugin code.
If you fork this project and do not need that fidelity, delete `HARNESS_GLYPHS`
and the `HarnessBadge` component together with the Harness settings row.
